Answer: The search result does not include any qualifications such as "at this time" or "unless you are symptomatic" in the U.S. Surgeon General's statement; it directly quotes Dr. Jerome Adams as saying masks are "not effective in preventing spread of COVID-19" and recommends focusing on other preventive actions to avoid mask shortages for healthcare workers.

